# Files kept in the repo but NOT deployed to contentify.dev.
#
# Persona Creator is a work in progress. Keeping it listed here means the source
# stays in version control and in your editor, but is never uploaded to Vercel —
# so /persona 404s and nobody can read the unfinished code via view-source.
#
# To re-enable it later:
#   1. Delete the persona.html line below.
#   2. In index.html, in the footer "Product" list, add this back between the
#      Person Generator and Content Library items:
#        <li><a href="./persona.html">Persona Creator</a></li>
#   3. Same in persona.html's own footer (search "Persona Creator — WIP").
#   4. Add the /persona <url> block back to sitemap.xml.
#   5. Remove the noindex meta and the WIP banner at the top of persona.html.
persona.html

# Source art kept in the repo but not needed on the live site.
# hero-ui.png (the optimised 1000w export) is what the hero actually loads.
hero-ui-original.png

# Local working files — these are untracked, so they only matter if you ever
# deploy with the `vercel` CLI from this folder instead of via Git.
inspo/
Contentify/
ui.html
*.xlsx
*.csv
.DS_Store
